            "Requires audit of all 24 email templates. Consider using media query prefers-color-scheme with fallback tables for Outlook.",
            null, 18),
        new("f2", "Bulk export to CSV", "requested", "medium", 87,
            "James Lin", "JL",
            "Allow users to select multiple records and export them as a CSV file. Currently only single-record JSON export is supported which slows down reporting workflows.",
            "Use streaming response for large datasets. Add column selection dialog before export.",
            null, 9),
        new("f3", "Keyboard shortcuts for navigation", "requested", "low", 53,
            "Dev Kapoor", "DK",
            "Power users want keyboard shortcuts for common actions like switching views, creating new items, and navigating between sections without touching the mouse.",
